        "ship_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we ship to many countries worldwide. International shipping rates and delivery times vary by destination. Shipping costs for international orders will be calculated at checkout based on your location and order weight. Please note that international orders may be subject to customs duties and taxes imposed by your country, which are the responsibility of the recipient. Delivery typically takes 7-21 business days for international orders.</p>",
            "open_default": false
          }
        },
        "ship_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your return policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer a 30-day free return policy. If you're not completely satisfied with your Carepod, you can return it within 30 days of delivery for a full refund. The product must be in its original packaging and in good condition. To initiate a return, contact our customer support team at hello@carepod.com and we'll provide you with a prepaid return shipping label. Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days after we receive the returned item.</p>",
            "open_default": false
          }
        },
        "ship_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What warranty does Carepod come with?",
            "answer": "<p>Every Carepod comes with a 1-year manufacturer's warranty that covers defects in materials and workmanship under normal household use. This includes the motor, electrical components, and stainless steel parts. The warranty does not cover damage from misuse, accidents, unauthorized modifications, or normal wear and tear (such as minor scratches on stainless steel surfaces). If you experience an issue covered by warranty, contact us at hello@carepod.com with your order number and a description of the problem, and we'll make it right.</p>",
            "open_default": false
          }
        },
        "ship_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I contact customer support?",
            "answer": "<p>You can reach our customer support team in several ways:<br><br><strong>Email:</strong> hello@carepod.com — we respond within 24 hours on business days.<br><strong>Contact Form:</strong> Visit our <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact page</a> and fill out the form.<br><br>Our support team is available Monday through Friday, 9 AM - 6 PM EST. We're happy to help with product questions, troubleshooting, returns, warranty claims, or anything else.</p>",
            "open_default": false
          }
        },
        "ship_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Once your order ships, you'll receive a shipping confirmation email with a tracking number and a link to track your package in real-time. You can also check your order status by visiting our website and using the order tracking page, or by contacting our customer support team with your order number. If you haven't received a shipping confirmation within 3 business days of placing your order, please check your spam folder or reach out to us.</p>",
            "open_default": false
